eight=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878420/extras/f2a3eb1deda54b241de2c1bce2a28f2b.webm?t=1755174301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878420/extras/f2a3eb1deda54b241de2c1bce2a28f2b.mp4?t=1755174301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees according to your needs and automate your store's processes. Be careful employees don\u2019t work for free! You can hire staff to help at the checkout, with cleaning, and with restocking your empty crates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and start your journey in Old Market Simulator today! Don't forget to share your feedback in the discussions and feel free to join our Discord channel, where we listen to you to make the game more fun!</p>",
